Accept: application/json

### 7.1.10 Chia sẻ media (trigger MediaShare + notification)
POST {{TuneVault.API_HostAddress}}/api/playlists/share/media
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "mediaId": "{{testMediaId}}",
  "senderId": "{{testSenderId}}",
  "receiverId": "{{testUserId}}"
}

